MyWall by David Prothero

This program is a simple wall program that allows users to post messages
(up to four lines).  This is my first program for CNet in C!  I hadn't
originally intended on releasing it, but it turned out a lot better than
I thought!  (Thanks to Abacus' "Amiga C for Beginners :)

Anyway, copy the MyWall executable to wherever your heart desires and
add it as a C Pfile somewhere (or use a \#2 somewhere).  Then, copy the
Wall.cfg file to your SysData: directory.  Edit that file (the file is
commented to help you out).

